{"id":28049,"author":"minertedtoad","body":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eAge: 14\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 700;\"\u003eTimezone:GMT \u0026nbsp;(\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb\u003eGreenwich mean time)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 700;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have Teamspeak? officalminertedtoad\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have Discord? officalminertedtoad\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have access to a recording software? Yes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 1: SELF REFLECTION/EVALUATION\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eDo you have any experience as a moderator on other servers? I partially have an experience as a moderator on another server\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eWhat is your biggest weakness and how will it affect your moderating? My biggest weakness is to be able to be on a lot\u0026nbsp;of the time. This will effect my moderating cause I won't be able to be on as much. However I will try to get my work done at school so I can moderate after school.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat qualities do you think a leader must have? Would you consider yourself a leader?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eWhy/why not?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eThe qualities a leader must have are:\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- Be able to listen to everyone's opinions,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- Be able to assist anyone who needs help,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- Be able to take part in the team effort,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- Be able to be online to help out,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- Tell the team when there not going to be on,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- Inform people of any changes,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e- Be able to help out if all other staff are occupied.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI wouldn't class myself as a leader because I can't be on all the time because of Irl stuff. Also I have alot of school work to do sometimes and that takes a while.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eWhat attributes distinguish yourself from other players that qualify you to be a moderator?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI have a previous experience of moderating and I also am good friends with most people on the server. I also like to give everyone a friendly greeting when they come on. I'm also a well know member and am able to distinguish people who do bad and good things.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhat skills do you believe you should have when interacting with the community? Do you believe you have these skills?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eI believe you should have:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e- A nice friendly greeting,\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e- Be able to listen to everyone's opinion,\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e- Not be rude to people,\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e- Not ignore people who I don't like,\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e- Be ready to listen to something someone wants to tell you even though you may find it boring.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eI believe I have these skills because I get along with everybody. Also I'm a well know member of avicus and everyone always treats me the same I would treat them.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat in your opinion are the three main character traits a moderator must have when moderating?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e- Strict\u003cbr\u003e- stubborn\u003cbr\u003e- Must follow the rules exactly.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 2: GENERAL SITUATIONS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou notice a moderator giving out a lot of false bans. They almost always have insufficient evidence or sometimes no evidence and they don’t seem to care. You notice it but other staff members don’t. What would you do?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eI would contact An admin with Evidence to prove that the moderator has been giving out false bans. I would let them unban the players because the moderator might then ban me.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou are in Teamspeak with a few other players and they begin talking quite disrespectfully about a particular staff member. You agree with what they’re saying to an extent, but the conversation starts to become racial and very disrespectful soon after. You are all in a nightclub channel where this is allowed. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI would ask the players not to talk about the staff member or take it to a private channel\u0026nbsp;were they could take about it there without making me uncomfortable. I would then go and talk to a senior and tell them what had happened.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou are in an Avicus team. One of your teammates is also an Avicus Staff member. One day in your team discord the team member/staff member posts a screenshot of a thread that only staff members can see. The content in the screenshot isn’t very important/confidential but only staff members could see it on the forums. If anything, what would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI would ask the staff not to post the screenshot for all staff to see. I would ask them to give the link to certain people that should be allowed to see it.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eS\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eome senior staff members are in teamspeak joking around with each other. They are removing others ranks, creating certain channels and even harassing certain users. They don’t mean any harm but some players in the channel feel a bit angry that they are using their permissions the way they are. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI would contact\u0026nbsp;a server administrator and tell the what had happened and provide evidence. I would only then - If that fails - try to contact a developer to sort out the situation.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 3: OTHER\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; text-decoration-line: underline;\"\u003eNOTE: This is a new criteria and these questions are less to do with right/wrong answer and more to do with us getting to know you. Please answer these honestly. There is no right or wrong answer.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhy do you want to be a moderator? I want to be a moderator because I would like to help out the server in some sort of way. Also I would like to get back into moderating on a different server.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eWhat does Avicus mean to you? Everything\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eAnything specific the staff team could do better? \u0026nbsp;Get better staff. Nemo and koja aren't nice to me.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhy did you choose to apply at Avicus? Because it is a good server. One of the best. Everyone makes me feel welcome and that's a server I want to be apart of.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eDo you have anything else to add to your application? No\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eAge: 14\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 700;\"\u003eTimezone:GMT \u0026nbsp;(\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb\u003eGreenwich mean time)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 700;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have Teamspeak? officalminertedtoad\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have Discord? officalminertedtoad\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have access to a recording software? Yes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 1: SELF REFLECTION/EVALUATION\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eDo you have any experience as a moderator on other servers? I partially have an experience as a moderator on another server\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eWhat is your biggest weakness and how will it affect your moderating? My biggest weakness is to be able to be on a lot\u0026nbsp;of the time. This will effect my moderating cause I won't be able to be on as much. However I will try to get my work done at school so I can moderate after school.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat qualities do you think a leader must have? Would you consider yourself a leader?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eWhy/why not?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eThe qualities a leader must have are:\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- Be able to listen to everyone's opinions,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- Be able to assist anyone who needs help,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- Be able to take part in the team effort,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- Be able to be online to help out,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- Tell the team when there not going to be on,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- Inform people of any changes,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e- Be able to help out if all other staff are occupied.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI wouldn't class myself as a leader because I can't be on all the time because of Irl stuff. Also I have alot of school work to do sometimes and that takes a while.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eWhat attributes distinguish yourself from other players that qualify you to be a moderator?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI have a previous experience of moderating and I also am good friends with most people on the server. I also like to give everyone a friendly greeting when they come on. I'm also a well know member and am able to distinguish people who do bad and good things.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhat skills do you believe you should have when interacting with the community? Do you believe you have these skills?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eI believe you should have:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e- A nice friendly greeting,\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e- Be able to listen to everyone's opinion,\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e- Not be rude to people,\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e- Not ignore people who I don't like,\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e- Be ready to listen to something someone wants to tell you even though you may find it boring.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eI believe I have these skills because I get along with everybody. Also I'm a well know member of avicus and everyone always treats me the same I would treat them.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat in your opinion are the three main character traits a moderator must have when moderating?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e- Strict\u003cbr\u003e- stubborn\u003cbr\u003e- Must follow the rules exactly.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 2: GENERAL SITUATIONS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou notice a moderator giving out a lot of false bans. They almost always have insufficient evidence or sometimes no evidence and they don’t seem to care. You notice it but other staff members don’t. What would you do?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eI would contact An admin with Evidence to prove that the moderator has been giving out false bans. I would let them unban the players because the moderator might then ban me.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou are in Teamspeak with a few other players and they begin talking quite disrespectfully about a particular staff member. You agree with what they’re saying to an extent, but the conversation starts to become racial and very disrespectful soon after. You are all in a nightclub channel where this is allowed. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI would ask the players not to talk about the staff member or take it to a private channel\u0026nbsp;were they could take about it there without making me uncomfortable. I would then go and talk to a senior and tell them what had happened.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou are in an Avicus team. One of your teammates is also an Avicus Staff member. One day in your team discord the team member/staff member posts a screenshot of a thread that only staff members can see. The content in the screenshot isn’t very important/confidential but only staff members could see it on the forums. If anything, what would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI would ask the staff not to post the screenshot for all staff to see. I would ask them to give the link to certain people that should be allowed to see it.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eS\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eome senior staff members are in teamspeak joking around with each other. They are removing others ranks, creating certain channels and even harassing certain users. They don’t mean any harm but some players in the channel feel a bit angry that they are using their permissions the way they are. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI would contact\u0026nbsp;a server administrator and tell the what had happened and provide evidence. I would only then - If that fails - try to contact a developer to sort out the situation.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 3: OTHER\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; text-decoration-line: underline;\"\u003eNOTE: This is a new criteria and these questions are less to do with right/wrong answer and more to do with us getting to know you. Please answer these honestly. There is no right or wrong answer.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhy do you want to be a moderator? I want to be a moderator because I would like to help out the server in some sort of way. Also I would like to get back into moderating on a different server.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eWhat does Avicus mean to you? Everything\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eAnything specific the staff team could do better? \u0026nbsp;Get better staff. Nemo and koja aren't nice to me.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhy did you choose to apply at Avicus? Because it is a good server. One of the best. Everyone makes me feel welcome and that's a server I want to be apart of.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eDo you have anything else to add to your application? No\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","created_at":1502211331,"title":"Moderator application august 2017.","replies":[{"id":378407,"author":"LFT","body":"\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-c50849d0-c345-2d87-8080-6c28bfc88c08\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e[Reviewing]\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e - Your application has been tagged reviewing and will remain like this until at least 4 other Senior Staff \u0026amp; Mentors read over your application and vote.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-c50849d0-c345-2d87-8080-6c28bfc88c08\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e[Reviewing]\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e - Your application has been tagged reviewing and will remain like this until at least 4 other Senior Staff \u0026amp; Mentors read over your application and vote.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e","created_at":1502219689},{"id":378846,"author":"BoldAndBrash","body":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e[Denied]\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- I am sorry to say your application has been denied for:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e- Recent punishments\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e- Bad handling of situations\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e- Inactivity\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51